A
Environment details
Tools. Table 5 lists the seven tools. Two design notes matter for the main text. First, issue_refund
validates only that the order exists, is not already refunded, and that the amount is positive and within
the order total; it has no eligibility gate, which is the permissiveness §3 rests on. Second, escalate
and reply never fail, and reply’s text is ignored by the environment entirely: prose has no effect on
the world, only on the customer.
Table 5: The seven tools. “Grounded args” are the arguments the rule checker traces back to the goal
or an earlier observation; escalate.reason and reply.text are deliberately excluded as prose.
